  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello, how are things going?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, good. Thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.83,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is there a polite way to tell my aunt I don't want her old books? She keeps giving me boxes.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's tricky, since she's being generous. You could thank her and say you're running out of space.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hold on, really?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.17,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_11",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "I'm fairly sure about it, but I could be wrong. What sounds off to you?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "She'll just say I should buy another shelf.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Ha, determined aunt. Maybe offer to help her find a good home for them instead, like a library sale or a school.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.61,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, that's clever. She'd love the idea of kids reading them.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.17,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly, she still gets to share them. You could keep one or two that really speak to you, so she feels heard.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.79,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "There's",
   "est_sec": 0.41,
   "gap_before": 1.81,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "one old atlas in there I actually like.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.95,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Keep the atlas then. Tell her it's your favorite, and she'll be delighted.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
